{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0cd68a7deeb0d5589eca6e9ef4c41a8e2a0198956fe916baf77a719274b74867","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_570b57f69372e1052cd7b133af4bb3673408a6c87215180a8a57736ad81e65c9"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The scan stage globs the project root, applies regex matchers to every matched file, and writes candidate matches into per-file FileRecords without any AI usage.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_10c58a31819b721241fcc455430122a92831b302f6f55b8013bba0f8ecb9433e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_85d411266fa3095cc24080332b508c759fa18c81222e5d9301d864718e1e9299","slc_9d07663489998534d86a58377d52d5b1db59885f982568bab0c7a90420180073"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"Three agent backends are supported for process: codex (default, via @openai/codex-sdk), claude (via @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk), and pi (via @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent), each with a documented default model.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3a44982f7830f0ddfd911d65ad3ee8c631bb4b12577bfd9a9ec30d95bf42a145","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cb16aa889aa2c72fb5d77695f747240a31297bcdd581f142dbaed7f03685b02e"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The processor claims files atomically via lockedByRunId so multiple workers can run in parallel; concurrency and batch size flags control how many files are in flight.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_41663151cac87722586eb3112a3d9ca5d0244b2c5ce391fef28f9e27db391c62","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e80f438f594126e979eafc851ebce3d2b1fcb05bedbc24ea10574b5d1a67292b"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"Because it uses top models at maximum thinking levels by default, scans of large codebases can cost thousands to tens of thousands of dollars, per the README's own cost warning.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4515bc54b8dea6324ec52352965a33d705d16f5b71fc42048f809b5d9dcbd3be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b6ab9cb6056a01d8f8f2c7467a0ca0dd87df8320e0da4c57e845dc2cdd8a1c6e"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"The CLI exposes subcommands including scan, process, process --diff, triage, revalidate, enrich, report, export, metrics, status, and sandbox for running any command on Vercel Sandbox microVMs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_464516511c0919624e784e1287d95cab321c0ff3b445638529795cef84d4a7c6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e8d3fa9abf7aac43adb82caffb27c7990ab3793caeaafe409bbe0e6e39a3d0a0"],"source_ids":["src_3eab186a3a045b25a3505f1bdfd3ed8d"],"text":"Each FileRecord tracks candidates, findings, an append-only analysisHistory, gitInfo, a lifecycle status (pending/processing/analyzed/error), and a lockedByRunId field used for atomic file claiming.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5351b712cea0ec0447ec8a87642522e69f09ec3ab43f435e88448376e24c5907","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6776e0d02d646b0fdddd993597a27190c77a49c3df8c73fb91fed9cd1a1b1e62"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"deepsec is an agent-powered vulnerability scanner that runs in the user's own infrastructure and is optimized for on-demand review of all code in large existing repositories.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ee99b1a49d13d324d18b0292ba5406d2d903686c0e73c9e10d61f23ac85d278","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d1c048c7563d88cd02d6dd3ecd4845995b98a265e05ffcd31f2662ec25a6719"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The setup coordinator uses a read-only agent to produce INFO.md and a structured surface inventory, evaluates scan coverage, generates data-only matcher specs validated for regex safety and slug collisions, and gates paid processing until coverage passes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7777d76bbabddc6e65eb53320a473bee7ba741f52299d0e907174cbed290f855","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63a37450f5f67635a91dd3bb67e60d9da8f3ed356966f2cced6dc2beab0bcbe5"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The process stage batches pending files, sends each batch to a configured AI agent backend with the system prompt and INFO.md, and parses JSON responses into findings stored on FileRecords.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_868d5db5ede5f73973baeac3c2fe9c0c8e2f0710ef309b7606f0f58b6ae7e8ff","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5ee9da72d9741b29fa6ec631e23a7371b5e8ca95230f4860e211a140700c37b6","slc_cea1301990624fa77d461b0f2d1c14ac523de9de9d82ed7fa73843d18ef06e97","slc_f69cbaf849c9173f945751e072592f890518e6aed9f2c135243eb1fd9ec78135"],"source_ids":["src_39098c834c805138a3e18506b459dbf8","src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The architecture doc describes five plugin extension points in packages/core/src/plugin.ts: matchers, notifiers, and agents are additive, while ownership, people, and executor are single-slot with last-write-wins ordering.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8ce0fb86a485d89e06007e71557f92699c8ad62d668c1ffa60ca24fbaf5ecc43","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_050c4f4b004ee8f3668785d0536e0de0600cfe27354713ad152fb61dcb284a8e","slc_9ef79a04605e4db80552a0cdac84f194d09f1d8f879987dde39d49fbba46aab8"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The revalidate stage re-checks findings for false positives using git history and, per the docs, empirically reduces the false-positive rate by 50% or more on most repos.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9805870812e23e8c45bc01b85f098cb82d63934be157bd09d42560b814462a54","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a0a32b5b596fe6445c230571f407398d530690915dec7ba782ceac0a7f3de86f","slc_ec3b202b2f489aa7b15ce9077f833a1f2a7bf4aac7315388c3d0e36095039aae"],"source_ids":["src_39098c834c805138a3e18506b459dbf8"],"text":"Configuration lives in deepsec.config.ts (or .mjs/.js/.cjs) resolved from the current directory walking upward, declaring projects, plugins, matcher filters, default agent/model/thinking level, AI route, and dataDir.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9f355c8aff5522ff4e5fff4d92c2cdf6af4521e831cb6e1ae00c01db6135e1ae","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d4708cc499914287a3b40b03fca34e987868dddd5038cd09d420082a792639a7","slc_f6df29827f6a0eb32f89526dc1250fb82810e429a454f0f60aacdbfba202b56c"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"Large monorepos can optionally fan work across Vercel Sandbox microVMs; the local working tree is tarballed and uploaded (excluding .git), and model credentials stay host-side and are injected only at the egress host.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b1249a365f93e8b24fc9c9eb9018cf0fec5f9eec118efbabafb3169fab884ae6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44b726525283b3857722b68fb339e619a046c6ab35aa369e5d0c47317b1a39c4","slc_6776e0d02d646b0fdddd993597a27190c77a49c3df8c73fb91fed9cd1a1b1e62"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a","src_e0c09dde63205b8cbe40769641c6669a"],"text":"deepsec targets teams wanting deep, long-running vulnerability review of large existing codebases, with per-finding triage (~1 cent per finding) and revalidation priced comparably to the AI process stage.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b2dfed48c617a9f5d12e5edd6b4643f2bcadeb989857841d6c018705cfcd7d0d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7c425deefe2257248f205ce7fdd9d3b134151ee343ca6307825b9b0e32923f8c","slc_9b636c7cea04169614e89455ee4e95753cb6e4a7ab5eeb8123805b22f9825f6c"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"The security model treats deepsec like a coding agent with full shell access on its host environment; in sandbox mode, agent API keys are injected outside the sandbox and worker egress is limited to coding-agent hosts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b37ec0fefb68564ecfa35c738009ab786ebd3dad642e86daf6f01dc594b706e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f51d16662ac36553c8b53740e3feeb0d76c95535cdbc22cfee6af829ccabb96"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"By default model calls route through Vercel AI Gateway; users can instead bring their own OpenAI, Anthropic, or custom HTTPS provider key via --model-auth direct with --ai-provider and --ai-api-key-env.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6bed49895eecebc40b35a02a6ad4fc03946a9346b3a4d1fc1919a1ddbba76ec","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f51d16662ac36553c8b53740e3feeb0d76c95535cdbc22cfee6af829ccabb96","slc_cefc8115c9969ec75f14bf31f15b87a19bf32b860cc70392c90edeeec0127eb5"],"source_ids":["src_3eab186a3a045b25a3505f1bdfd3ed8d","src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"Only the name of the environment variable holding the model key is stored, never the key value itself; setup-state evidence likewise contains no credential values.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bb5b194cf2f2df691e327770bca86bd9eaa7e2c15fe808a947e6585cdbac2611","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3ea74cbe3d9aad300a1421f1d85bcd61fbef95c5d337aa757e9a3d498612e603"],"source_ids":["src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"The unit of work is a source file rather than a finding, which the architecture doc says makes per-file atomic locking and idempotent merges natural.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c1cb44e3925745ed552930bc70b4e219fd30ee62dabc58da7de0d9bf2bfb1b0a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_28c5474d4eba18f01fa30f0efafe566fee1f4bdccf5aa73ff14ff168d85edb52","slc_413a4265df77cb8c514956999424c5faa9457e425fef44128f2c5561ed0227e9"],"source_ids":["src_3eab186a3a045b25a3505f1bdfd3ed8d","src_5d9a5dc55ea55e04847a27bf7a0e0ba8"],"text":"On-disk state is append-only: re-scans merge new candidates, re-processing appends to analysisHistory and merges findings, and revalidation annotates findings with verdicts without overwriting or deleting anything.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cf77ee141d897b14cc35dd32e20cbd72396bd21915c0650cb9c4a8b573b60d40","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_dc712595cffc4c496861c874624f36bdd13787736f8f6c79ad6768f2355de2d9"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"For large codebases, work fans out across worker machines in parallel, and interrupted or errored runs can be re-run to resume, skipping already-analyzed files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d1e35c69c040e76a282f80e6fb2785a1dc796ff0e0cafbf8609435a4aaa46688","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"vercel-labs/deepsec@23a69227e338 snapshot 83b78ffadd29c0d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7c425deefe2257248f205ce7fdd9d3b134151ee343ca6307825b9b0e32923f8c"],"source_ids":["src_ad7fe86ac0ca5d07be8665481b82df3a"],"text":"The README warns of prompt-injection risk from external dependencies or vendored code even though the tool is designed to run on trusted source code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25e0ec2c3a2e461b8e37bc1eef5a8fa8"}
